@exhibitionId = 9b1d5e2a-0c4f-4e7a-9a51-3f1c0e8b0001

### Aktiv version (seedet)
GET {{Oekolariet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/exhibitions/{{exhibitionId}}/active-version
